# Copy to .env (gitignored) and edit. Compose and the Makefile read it.

# The Service Bus emulator and the SQL Server it stores messages in are licensed under
# Microsoft's EULAs; setting Y accepts them. With N the stack runs without a queue and the
# queue contract tests skip.
#   https://github.com/Azure/azure-service-bus-emulator-installer/blob/main/EMULATOR_EULA.txt
#   https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=857698  (SQL Server Developer edition)
ACCEPT_EULA=N
